{
  "title": "make load-test fails with missing --server-url / --ui-url",
  "description": "The Makefile `load-test` target runs `cd cli && cargo run -q -- load-test` without loading dev.env, so the CLI's `--server-url` (env API_BASE_URL) and `--ui-url` (env UI_BASE_URL) are unset and clap errors out. \
This is the same bug `make seed` had. \
Source dev.env as `seed` now does and pass `--server-url \"${API_BASE_URL:-http://localhost:$PORT}\"` and a UI URL derived from dev.env (likely `${UI_BASE_URL:-$RAMEKIN_SELF_SIGNED_URL}`; check which origin load_test.rs expects).",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 3,
  "type": "bug",
  "labels": [
    "dev-environment",
    "cli",
  ],
